catflow 0.8
1. Read Files            tickets/; pattern=*.txt
2. <each one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Text            (input:1)
     2. Extract Structured               Qwen3 8B; "product, issue_type,
                                         severity"
     3. Table to Text                    format=csv
3. Join Text             separator="\n"
4. Text to Table         expected="product, issue_type, severity"
5. Query Table           group=issue_type
6. Chart                 kind=bar; x=issue_type; y=count
7. Save Image            issues-this-week.png
8. Table to Text   (4)   format=markdown
9. Save Text             tickets-structured.md
